    "updated_at": "2022-11-10T01:25:09Z",
    "body": "Perhaps a simple solution might be to add a `isUserInitiated` (bool) either as IDL attribute or internal slot on the `Event` interface. Then HTML can check for that being `true` to count as  transient activation. \r\n\r\n@annevk, @domenic, @mustaqahmed, @michaelwasserman thoughts? ",
