    "created_at": "2022-11-10T01:50:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-10T01:50:15Z",
    "body": "For the internal slot route, we could even be very specific for now, and just have something like \"is a user-initiated orientation change event\" or \"is a special activation triggering event\".",
