    "created_at": "2022-11-10T02:02:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-11-10T02:02:28Z",
    "body": "Actually, `.isTrusted` could work if `screen.orientation.lock()` consumes the user activation, because then there would be no opportunity to call `.requestFullscreen()` or any other API gated on user activation.\r\n\r\nHowever, there is some concern that changing the Screen Orientation spec might not be web compatible: https://github.com/w3c/screen-orientation/pull/218\r\n\r\nBut `.isTrusted` does provide a really elegant solution if we can change the orientation spec.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
