    "body": "Granting transient user activation on orientation changes seems convenient, if excessive.\r\n\r\nI think Chrome currently [grants fullscreen during execution of screen.orientation `change` event listeners](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/screen_orientation/screen_orientation_controller.cc;l=206;drc=6dc39d60fea45c003424272efdb4c366119a9d7f;bpv=0;bpt=1#:~:text=205-,206,-207), not for a fixed duration after the event.",
