    "body": "It's definitely a tradeoff between convenience and excessiveness, as I outlined in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8490#issuecomment-1311093555. I come down on the convenience side, but if Gecko and Chromium would prefer defining a new concept to ensure we avoid any extra transient activations, that's probably fine...",
